  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "問題なさそうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010110150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201011/2002010110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010110160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201011/2002010110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010110170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "実は、少し不安だったんです",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201011/2002010110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010110180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私はコミュニケーションを取るのが得意ではないので……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201011/2002010110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010110190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ひとりで子どもたちを喜ばせられるのかなって\r\nそう思っていました",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201011/2002010110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010110200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、衣装を着ると、\r\n自分じゃない自分になれる気がするんです",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201011/2002010110200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自分じゃない自分……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010110210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あっ、すみません\r\n少し違いますね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201011/2002010110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010110220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ええと……スイッチみたいなイメージでしょうか",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201011/2002010110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010110230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "アイドルの風野灯織に切り替わる感覚というか……\r\nただの私よりも、少し自信を持っている私になれるというか",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201011/2002010110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……その感覚は俺もわかる気がするな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010110240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "もしかして、スーツですか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201011/2002010110240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう。だから、山歩きの時は\r\nオフっていうか、普通に楽しんでた部分もあってさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──って、これオフレコな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010110250,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふっ、はい",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201011/2002010110250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010110260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……みんな、そうなんですよね",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201011/2002010110260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010110270,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_a",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201011/2002010110270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010110280,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "この衣装を着た私なら、\r\nきっと子どもたちとおしゃべりできます",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201011/2002010110280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010110290,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "このイベントを一緒に楽しむことも、できる……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201011/2002010110290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう\r\n楽しいイベントだ。灯織も楽しんでおいで",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
